# Whitelist: only the mods, tools and docs are published. Game data (extracted/, backup/), work copies of game
# files (work/) and anything decompiled never leave this machine.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!VERSION
!LICENSE
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**
!mods/
!mods/**
!tools/
!tools/**
!installer/
!loader/
!loader/**
!plugins/
!devtools/
!devtools/**
devtools/**/bin/
devtools/**/obj/
!plugins/**
plugins/**/bin/
plugins/**/obj/
!installer/**
installer/bin/
installer/obj/
tools/__pycache__/
mods/**/bin/
mods/**/obj/
# content-pack 3D models: Gloomhaven's own bundles (tens of MB each), rebuilt by tools/gh_port.py, carried by the release zip
mods/**/bundles/
tools/**/bin/
tools/**/obj/
!companion/
!companion/**
companion/.venv-build/
companion/build/
companion/build-res/
companion/dist/
companion/logs/
companion/webview2/
companion/cache/
companion/**/__pycache__/
